<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
    "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html style="width:100%; font-family: 'Montserrat', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Montserrat:400,500,600,700" rel="stylesheet">
    <style type="text/css">
        body,
        table,
        td,
        p,
        a,
        li {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        strong {
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #be1d2c;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        ul {
            margin: 8px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 768px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <table align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            <tbody>
                {{> header }}

                <tr>
                    <td class="section">
                        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
                        <p><span class="highlight">Congratulations!</span></p>

                        <p>You've successfully cleared the previous round, and we're thrilled to invite you to the next stage of the interview process at <strong>{{#if organization.name}}{{organization.name}}{{else}}Letshire{{/if}}</strong>.</p>

                        <p><strong>Round 2 Details:</strong><br />
                            • <strong>Exam URL:</strong> {{registrationUrl}}<br />
                            • <strong>Exam Start Time:</strong> {{examStartTime}}<br />
                            • <strong>Exam End Time:</strong> {{examEndTime}}<br />
                            <em>Note: The exam will begin only at the scheduled start time. Please log in a few minutes early and be prepared.</em>
                        </p>

                        <p><strong>Important Instructions:</strong></p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>The exam must be taken on a mobile device.</li>
                            <li>Do not switch tabs during the test – tab switches will be tracked and counted.</li>
                            <li>Make sure you're in a quiet environment with a stable internet connection.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p><strong>Video Round Requirement:</strong><br />
                            During the exam, you’ll be asked to record a 1-minute video:<br />
                            <em>“Why should you be hired for this position?”</em><br />
                            Speak clearly and confidently – this is your moment to shine!
                        </p>

                        <p>Once this round is complete, our team will be in touch regarding the next steps.</p>

                        <p>Wishing you the best of luck!<br />
                            – Team {{#if organization.name}}{{organization.name}}{{else}}Letshire{{/if}}</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                {{> footer }}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
